---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy and personal data protection — Despot nekretnine."
  noIndex={true}
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="page-hero section-sm">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Legal information</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Last updated: May 2025.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container policy-layout">
      <div class="policy-content">

        <div class="policy-intro">
          <p>
            Despot nekretnine (hereinafter: "we", "our agency") is committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains what data we collect, how we use it and what your rights are in accordance with the Law on Personal Data Protection of the Republic of Serbia ("Official Gazette of RS", No. 87/2018).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">1.</span> Data controller</h2>
          <p>The controller of personal data is:</p>
          <div class="policy-infobox">
            <p><strong>{site.name}</strong></p>
            <p>{site.contact.address}</p>
            <p>E-mail: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a></p>
            <p>Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.contact.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{site.contact.phone}</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">2.</span> What data we collect</h2>
          <p>Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect the following categories of data:</p>
          <ul class="policy-list">
            <li><strong>Contact data</strong> — name and surname, phone number, e-mail address</li>
            <li><strong>Property data</strong> — location, description and characteristics of the property you wish to sell or rent</li>
            <li><strong>Communication data</strong> — content of messages you send us via e-mail, phone or Instagram direct messages</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not collect sensitive categories of data (health data, biometric data, etc.).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">3.</span> Purpose and legal basis of processing</h2>
          <table class="policy-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Purpose of processing</th>
                <th>Legal basis</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Responding to inquiries and providing information about services</td>
                <td>Legitimate interest (Art. 12(1)(f) LPDP)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Concluding and executing a brokerage contract</td>
                <td>Contract performance (Art. 12(1)(b) LPDP)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Keeping records required by law</td>
                <td>Legal obligation (Art. 12(1)(c) LPDP)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">4.</span> How long we keep your data</h2>
          <p>We retain personal data only for as long as necessary for the purpose for which it was collected:</p>
          <ul class="policy-list">
            <li>Inquiry and pre-contractual data — up to 6 months after the last contact, unless a contract has been concluded</li>
            <li>Contractual data — 5 years from the end of the contractual relationship, in accordance with legal obligations</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">5.</span> Who has access to your data</h2>
          <p>We do not sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties, except:</p>
          <ul class="policy-list">
            <li>Notaries, lawyers and other parties whose participation is necessary for concluding the transaction</li>
            <li>Competent state authorities, in the event of a legal obligation</li>
          </ul>
          <p>All persons who have access to personal data are bound by a confidentiality obligation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">6.</span> Your rights</h2>
          <p>In accordance with the applicable legislation, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="policy-list">
            <li><strong>Access</strong> — to obtain confirmation as to whether your personal data is being processed</li>
            <li><strong>Rectification</strong> — to request correction of inaccurate data</li>
            <li><strong>Erasure</strong> — to request deletion, when the conditions provided by law are met</li>
            <li><strong>Restriction of processing</strong> — to request limitation of processing in certain circumstances</li>
            <li><strong>Objection</strong> — to object to processing based on legitimate interest</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you believe that your data is being processed in violation of applicable regulations, you have the right to file a complaint with the Commissioner for Information of Public Importance and Personal Data Protection.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-section">
          <h2><span class="policy-num">7.</span> Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to update this privacy policy. Any significant changes will be published on this page with an updated date. We recommend that you check this policy periodically.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background-color: #000000;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .page-hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .policy-layout {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .policy-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .policy-intro p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .policy-num {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .policy-section p a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .policy-section p a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .policy-list {
    padding: 0 0 0 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .policy-infobox {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-gold);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-infobox p {
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem !important;
  }

  .policy-infobox a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .policy-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .policy-table th,
  .policy-table td {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .policy-table th {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }
</style>
